  "summary": [
    "Boundary between backend-independent parts (DLID, checks, confirmed ToC) and backend-dependent parts (AI-generated fields, search, doc-db update)",
    "Backend decision: .doc-link/config.json force switch (auto or toc), invalid-value rejection, no per-call override",
    "doc-db connection and startup: MCP initialize check, executable resolution, user permission, detached launch, bounded reconnect, startup-failure stop",
    "Failure classification table: unreachable, startup failure, OpenAI failure, fault, and handling of doc-db versions not meeting the contract",
    "Management state: unfilled AI-generated fields, no doc-db sync record, sync before every search",
    "doc-db identification: KEY, series, path and local_path conventions",
    "doc-db sync: list creation from confirmed ToC, job execution, completion judgment, state transitions",
    "Index build and search flows, pre-search check behavior per backend, mapping chunk results to documents and sections, result contract",
    "Automatic switching notices, unchanged check/resolve SKILLs, setup and credential notes, relation to existing designs, open and unconfirmed items"
  ],
  "tasks": [
    "Implementing backend decision and doc-db connection or startup scripts",
    "Implementing doc-db sync and search in query-docs",
    "Implementing index-docs build flow with backend switching",
    "Designing or reviewing fallback from doc-db to ToC and user notifications",
    "Editing .doc-link/config.json handling",
    "Mapping doc-db search results to document IDs and sections",
    "Reviewing consistency with REQ-006 and existing designs DES-001 to DES-010"
  ],
